WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.295
Your street, as tonight begins.

00:02.995 --> 00:06.556
This is your part of the world as tonight's dark arrives.

00:07.006 --> 00:10.134
In a moment we go down to the ground and look up.

00:10.584 --> 00:17.372
Everything you are about to see is worked out for this place and this night, so you can go outside and check it.
